(footprint "BAT-HLD-001_CR2032_NarrowBoard"
  (version 20240108)
  (generator "saopp_gen_footprints")
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "covid-test copy of lib/sao-plus-plus.pretty/SAOPP_BAT-01 (same clip pads 1.8 x 5.2, 21.0 apart) with the 17 mm cell disc (pad 2) cut to a 14.9 mm wide band so it fits a 16 mm wide board; the two clip pads are joined by the clip itself (duplicate_pad_numbers_are_jumpers). Original note: CR2032 retainer clip, TE/Linx BAT-HLD-001 (LCSC C7501066). Drawing: https://www.lcsc.com/datasheet/C7501066.pdf (recommended footprint: two 1.8 x 5.2 pads 21.0 apart, 17.0 dia cell pad). Pads 1 = clip = cell PLUS; pad 2 = bare 17 mm disc under the cell = cell MINUS (no paste; use ENIG). The clip fits the pads either way round: the open side must face +Y of this footprint (arrow), where the cell slides in. Keep parts and exposed copper out of the 10.5 mm radius circle.")
  (tags "SAO++ CR2032 coin cell holder BAT-HLD-001")
